msgstr "日本式おもてなし"

#: website/templates/website/home.html:108
msgid "What Makes Us Different"
msgstr "私たちの強み"

#: website/templates/website/home.html:109
msgid "The three pillars of FUMIHEALING:"
msgstr "FUMIHEALING: の3つの柱"

#: website/templates/website/home.html:115
msgid "Balance First"
msgstr "まず整える"

#: website/templates/website/home.html:116
msgid ""
"Most approaches simply drain lymph. We balance the structure first — "
"muscles, posture, breathing — so the body flows naturally on its own."
msgstr ""
"多くのアプローチはただリンパを流すだけです。私たちはまず構造——筋肉、姿勢、呼"
"吸——を整えます。そうすることで、体は自然と流れ始めます。"

#: website/templates/website/home.html:121
msgid "Deep, Not Superficial"
msgstr "深く、表面だけではなく"

#: website/templates/website/home.html:122
msgid ""
"Superficial massage brings temporary relief. Deep lymph care addresses the "
"root cause: muscle tension and structural imbalance that block the flow."
msgstr ""
"表面的なマッサージは一時的な楽さをもたらします。深リンパケアは根本原因——流れ"
"を妨げる筋肉の緊張と構造的不均衡——にアプローチします。"

#: website/templates/website/home.html:127
msgid "Shiatsu Integration"
msgstr "指圧との融合"

#: website/templates/website/home.html:128
msgid ""
"We combine lymph drainage (area work) with shiatsu (point work) to create "
"lasting change — not just a moment of ease, but a new bodily state."
msgstr ""
"リンパドレナージ（面の施術）と指圧（点の施術）を組み合わせ、持続的な変化を生"
"み出します——一時的な楽さではなく、新しい体の状態を。"

#: website/templates/website/home.html:137
msgid "Training School"
msgstr "スクール"

#: website/templates/website/home.html:138
msgid "Become a certified FUMIHEALING: therapist"
msgstr "FUMIHEALING: 認定セラピストになる"

#: website/templates/website/home.html:141
msgid ""
"We are training the next generation of high-quality therapists in Uzbekistan "
"— therapists who carry not just technique, but the Japanese spirit of care."
msgstr ""
"ウズベキスタンで次世代の高品質なセラピストを育成しています——技術だけでなく、"
"日本式のケアの精神を持つセラピストを。"

#: website/templates/website/home.html:144
msgid "Learn More"
msgstr "詳しく見る"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:3
msgid "The Method"
msgstr "メソッド"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:4
msgid ""
"Learn about the FUMIHEALING: deep lymph care method — balance, depth, and "
"the Japanese approach to healing."
msgstr ""
"FUMIHEALING: の深リンパケアメソッドについて——バランス、深さ、そして日本式癌し"
"のアプローチ。"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:10
msgid "The FUMIHEALING: Method"
msgstr "FUMIHEALING: メソッド"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:11
msgid "Not force. Not just drainage. True balance."
msgstr "力ではない。流すだけでもない。真のバランス。"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:19
#: website/templates/website/school.html:59
msgid "Philosophy"
msgstr "フィロソフィー"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:20
msgid "What is Japanese-style lymph care?"
msgstr "日本式リンパケアとは"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:23
msgid ""
"Japanese style is not about using force, nor is it simply about continuously "
"draining fluid. For us, the most important concept is 'balance'."
msgstr ""
"日本式は、力を使うことでも、ただ流し続けることでもありません。私たちにとって"
"最も大切な概念は「整える」ことです。"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:26
msgid ""
"In Japan, since ancient times, correcting posture, regulating breathing, and "
"balancing internal systems have been considered essential. The essence of "
"the Japanese approach is balancing the internal state, not the external."
msgstr ""
"日本では古くから、姿勢を整えること、呼吸を調えること、内側のシステムをバラン"
"スさせることが重視されてきました。日本式の本質は、外側ではなく内側の状態を整"
"えることです。"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:29
msgid "We do not drain. We balance — and the body flows naturally on its own."
msgstr "私たちは流しません。整えます——すると体は自然と流れ始ます。"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:44
msgid "The Difference"
msgstr "違い"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:45
msgid "Why deep matters"
msgstr "なぜ深さが重要なのか"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:47
msgid ""
"Most lymph care methods target only the surface layer. This creates "
"temporary relief — but the problem returns quickly."
msgstr ""
"多くのリンパケア方法は表層にしかアプローチしません。そのため一時的な楽さは"
"あっても、すぐに戻ってしまいます。"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:48
msgid ""
"The lymph blockage causes are deep: muscle tension, postural imbalance, "
"shallow breathing, internal organ fatigue, nervous system dysregulation."
msgstr ""
"リンパの詰まりの原因は深いところにあります：筋肉の緊張、姿勢の乱れ、浅い呼"
"吸、内臓の疲れ、自律神経の乱れなど。"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:49
msgid ""
"By working the deep layer, muscles release, breathing changes, and flow "
"naturally improves. The change becomes lasting, not temporary."
msgstr ""
"深い層にアプローチすることで、筋肉が緩み、呼吸が変わり、流れが自然に改善しま"
"す。変化は一時的ではなく、持続的なものになります。"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:61
msgid "Comparison"
msgstr "比較"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:62
msgid "FUMIHEALING: vs other approaches"
msgstr "FUMIHEALING: と他のアプローチ"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:67
msgid "Other Styles"
msgstr "他のスタイル"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:73
msgid "Relaxation — pleasant sensation, temporary change"
msgstr "リラクゼーション——心地よい感覚、一時的な変化"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:74
msgid "Structural change — lasting results"
msgstr "構造的変化——持続的な結果"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:77
msgid "Targets superficial layer"
msgstr "表層へのアプローチ"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:78
msgid "Works the deep layer"
msgstr "深層へのアプローチ"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:81
msgid "Drain first, then relax"
msgstr "まず流して、リラックス"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:82
msgid "Balance first, then flow"
msgstr "まず整えて、流す"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:85
msgid "Oil massage — sliding technique"
msgstr "オイルマッサージ——滑らせる技術"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:86
msgid "Shiatsu + lymph — point & area combined"
msgstr "指圧＋リンパ——点と面の組み合わせ"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:89
msgid "Effect fades quickly"
msgstr "効果はすぐに消える"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:90
msgid "The body learns a new, healthy state"
msgstr "体が新しい、健康な状態を覚える"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:102
msgid "Technique"
msgstr "テクニック"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:103
msgid "Why we pause — and wait"
msgstr "なぜ止めて、待つのか"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:105
msgid "The body does not change the moment pressure is applied."
msgstr "体は、圧をかけた瞬間には変化しません。"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:109
msgid "Muscles need time to release"
msgstr "筋肉が緩むには時間が必要"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:110
msgid ""
"Rushing past this moment means the next touch lands before the body has "
"responded."
msgstr "急いで次に進むと、体が反応する前に次の刷激が入ってしまいます。"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:115
msgid "Breathing needs time to shift"
msgstr "呼吸が変わるには時間が必要"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:116
msgid ""
"A change in breath is a change in the whole nervous system — and that "
"requires space."
msgstr "呼吸の変化は、神経系全体の変化。そのためには「間」が必要です。"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:121
msgid "The nervous system needs time to respond"
msgstr "神経系が反応するには時間が必要"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:122
msgid ""
"When we apply pressure and wait, the body begins to change in that interval. "
"This 'gap' is where real transformation happens."
msgstr ""
"圧をかけて待つと、その「間」に体が変わり始めます。この「間」こそが、本当の変"
"化が起きる場所です。"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:127
msgid "Apply pressure. Then wait. In that pause, the body begins to change."
msgstr "圧をかける。そして待つ。その静けさの中で、体は変わり始める。"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:140
msgid "Shiatsu"
msgstr "指圧"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:141
msgid "The role of shiatsu"
msgstr "指圧の役割"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:144
msgid ""
"In FUMIHEALING:, shiatsu is not a pressure technique — it is a balancing "
"technique. Lymph drainage works across areas (surface); shiatsu works at "
"points (depth). By combining area and point, the body's transformation "
"deepens."
msgstr ""
"FUMIHEALING: において指圧は、押す技術ではなく「整える技術」です。リンパドレ"
"ナージは面（表層）で流す。指圧は点（深層）で整える。面と点を組み合わせること"
"で、体の変化が深まります。"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:146
msgid "Learn This Method"
msgstr "このメソッドを学ぶ"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:4
msgid ""
"Train as a FUMIHEALING: therapist. Learn Japanese deep lymph care in "
"Uzbekistan."
msgstr ""
"FUMIHEALING: セラピストとして学びましょう。ウズベキスタンで日本式深リンパケア"
"を習得。"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:10
msgid "FUMIHEALING: School"
msgstr "FUMIHEALING: スクール"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:11
msgid "Training high-quality therapists in Uzbekistan."
msgstr "ウズベキスタンで高品質なセラピストを育成。"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:19
msgid "Training"
msgstr "トレーニング"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:20
msgid "More than technique — a calling"
msgstr "技術以上のもの——それは天職"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:23
msgid ""
"FUMIHEALING: is not just a massage method. It is a career path and a life "
"skill. We train therapists who can work independently, support their "
"families, and make a meaningful difference in the lives of their clients."
msgstr ""
"FUMIHEALING: は単なるマッサージ方法ではありません。それはキャリアパスであり、"
"人生のスキルです。自立して働き、家族を支え、クライアントの人生に意味ある変化"
"をもたらせるセラピストを育てています。"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:26
msgid ""
"Our school teaches the full FUMIHEALING: method: philosophy, lymph theory, "
"practical technique, and the Japanese spirit of omotenashi (hospitality)."
msgstr ""
"私たちのスクールでは、FUMIHEALING: メソッドを全体的に教えます：哲学、リンパ理"
"論、実践テクニック、そして日本のおもてなしの精神。"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:31
msgid "hour course"
msgstr "時間コース"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:35
msgid "modules"
msgstr "モジュール"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:39
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Languages"
msgid "languages"
msgstr "対応言語"

